 calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Logan County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 years, more than any other pair. Last year was short in spots, with August to September at 37% of normal in 2025 on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grid 24163 fell to 59% of normal that year.</p>"}
